# The shipped layer 2 prompt must be byte-identical on every platform. Its
# sha256 is a published artefact: `python -m declutter.prompts` prints it and
# tests/test_prompts.py pins it. A CRLF checkout on Windows changes those bytes,
# which changes the hash and breaks the pinned test, so this file is always
# checked out with LF endings regardless of core.autocrlf.
src/declutter/prompts/layer2.md text eol=lf
